(text "TUB 1 PRE-REGULATOR BOARD (bom 17o) - SEPARATE PCB: all symbols here are on_board=no. One 6 VAC / 20 VA R-core transformer per channel - THT, SOLDERED ON THIS BOARD (ACENTRY sheet); secondaries land directly on the bridge diodes (AC6_x1/AC6_x2 globals). Branches are NEVER paralleled: each TPS7A4501 output is an independent rail. V4P3_LA->V33CLK+P5A_L, V4P3_LB->V33D+P5A_R, V4P3_LC->V33FF_L (U705, FF dual-mono split), V4P3_RA->V33FF_R, V4P3_RB->V33RLY. J703 mates main-board J603 (Conn2 north), J704 mates J604 (Conn3 south) through the SEAR-40 interposers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "97344f59-65fa-4746-98b8-0689d6c24c22"))
(text "Reservoir sizing (per transformer, 2 A DC worst): 3 x 10,000 uF/16 V high-ripple 105 C = 30 mF; ~1 V pp ripple at 50 Hz/-10% line -> trough ~5.8 V vs the 4.8 V floor (4.3 V out + 0.5 V TPS7A4501 dropout budget). P16A/N16A/V8P3 stages are DRAWN below (bottom strip, 2026-10-28 - 115 V mains ruling). Mains fuse/switch/inlet filter live in the chassis DD12 PEM (see ACENTRY); PE bond at the module." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 24.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3cbcac33-1f1b-4275-b7be-4f0accd9ce0c"))
