(text "SHARED-RAIL STAGES (bom 17o; 115 V mains ruling 2026-10-28): T902 2x18 VAC series-aided 18-0-18 (S2+S3 = CT = GND, tied at T902 on ACENTRY) -> bridge + snubbers -> +-24 V raw (2x10 mF/50 V per rail) -> U7801 LM317 = P16A +16.24 V, U7802 LM337 = N16A -16.24 V (240/2.87k on 1.25 V ref; 1.5k OUT bleeders = ~16 mA total min load; TO-220s need heatsinks ~4 W each @0.5 A). T903 9 VAC -> bridge -> ~12 V raw -> U7901 TPS7A4501 = V8P3 8.35 V (59k/10k on 1.21 V). Shared rails feed BOTH SEAF mates." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 300.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "04090f96-ef06-48d1-bde1-ff572cf2c867"))
